  "description": "<p>This personalized area rug features a dynamic racing design, complete with a checkered flag pattern and a realistic race track. It's designed to bring the excitement of motorsports into your home, making it a distinctive addition to any room. Ideal for enhancing themed spaces, this rug combines visual appeal with practical features for everyday use.</p>\n<h3>Product Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Features a custom name option with detailed racing and checkered flag graphics.</li>\n<li>Vibrant motorsports design brings energy to game rooms, garages, or kids' spaces.</li>\n<li>Soft yet durable polyester surface ensures comfort underfoot.</li>\n<li>Non-slip rubber backing provides confident grip in high-traffic areas.</li>\n<li>Versatile decor suitable for game rooms, patios, entries, or living spaces.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Game Room, Garage, Kid's Space, Patio, Entry, Living Space</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Checkered</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Racing, Motorsports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h3>Material &amp; Care</h3>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy, Non-slip Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h3>Where It Works</h3>\n<p>This racing-themed area rug is perfect for adding a touch of excitement to game rooms, garages, or any kid's space. Its durable and versatile design also makes it suitable for patios, entryways, or living rooms, complementing various home decor styles.</p>",
